# The benchmark-owned build of the library, produced by
#   npx ui5 build --dest benchmark/.dist
# It is a build artefact, not a source: the root .gitignore only covers `dist/`.
# The harness prefers this copy over the shared `dist/` so that a concurrent
# `npm run build --clean-dest` cannot delete the artefact out from under a run.
.dist/

# results/baseline.json and BASELINE.md are deliberately NOT ignored: the committed
# baseline is the thing a later run is diffed against.
